{"claims":[{"excerpt":"De POA-refunddienst ging na twaalf weken publiek live.","claim":"De POA-refunddienst werd twaalf weken na de start publiek gelanceerd.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"We passed alpha and beta Service Standard assessments and launched to the public in only 12 weeks.","narrative":"Het POA-refundteam lanceerde de dienst na twaalf weken","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source and narrative both state that the service launched publicly in twelve weeks.","materiality":"This establishes the delivery timeline."},{"excerpt":"Levering binnen de aanvankelijk gevraagde paar weken werd niet haalbaar geacht als de gebruikersdienst kwalitatief moest blijven.","claim":"Het team concluded that delivery within the initially requested few weeks was not feasible while maintaining service quality.","category":"certainty","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"We were initially asked to deliver the service in a matter of weeks, which put huge pressure on everyone and we quickly discovered would not be possible if we wanted to create a quality service for our users.","narrative":"de aanvankelijk gevraagde levering binnen enkele weken niet haalbaar werd geacht met behoud van een kwalitatieve gebruikersdienst.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This accurately preserves both the initial timeframe and the stated condition that the service should be of quality.","materiality":"It explains the constraint without claiming the team met the initially requested timeframe."},{"excerpt":"In de aanpak kwam eerst de ervaring van aanvragers: die werd naar alpha gebracht.","claim":"The team prioritized the applicant experience and took it to the alpha assessment.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"My team focused on the users applying for refunds first and this is what we took to the alpha assessment.","narrative":"De aanvragerservaring werd eerst naar alpha gebracht","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source explicitly says the team focused on refund applicants first and took this work to alpha.","materiality":"This identifies the order of work and the user group represented at alpha."},{"excerpt":"Het werk voor caseworkers kwam later.","claim":"Work for caseworkers came later than the applicant-focused work.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"Plans for the caseworker user came later.","narrative":"plannen voor caseworkers kwamen later.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This matches the source's stated sequence.","materiality":"It describes which user group the team addressed later."},{"excerpt":"Tijdens de private beta wisselden tweewekelijkse sprints elkaar af.","claim":"During private beta, fortnightly sprints alternated with one another.","category":"chronology","label":"F2 material incorrect, unsupported or misleading","evidence":"We achieved this by splitting our fortnightly sprints in two: testing, researching and accepting applications in the first week and then suspending submissions to concentrate on testing, researching and processing applications the second.","narrative":"Tijdens de private beta wisselden tweewekelijkse sprints af","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source describes each fortnightly sprint as split into two weeks, not alternating fortnightly sprints. The narrative uses the same misleading compression, which the content carries forward.","materiality":"It changes the described cadence and could lead readers to understand the workflow as alternating whole sprints rather than two different weeks within each sprint."},{"excerpt":"In de ene periode werden aanvragen aangenomen; in de andere was tijd gereserveerd voor testen, onderzoek en verwerking.","claim":"The workflow separated application intake into one period and reserved the other period for testing, research and processing.","category":"technical","label":"F2 material incorrect, unsupported or misleading","evidence":"We achieved this by splitting our fortnightly sprints in two: testing, researching and accepting applications in the first week and then suspending submissions to concentrate on testing, researching and processing applications the second.","narrative":"tussen aanvragen aannemen en tijd besteden aan testen, onderzoek en verwerking.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source says the first week also included testing and research, while submissions were suspended in the second week. The content's contrast obscures both details and implies a cleaner separation of activities.","materiality":"It materially alters the account of how intake, testing, research and processing were scheduled."},{"excerpt":"Zo zag het werkritme eruit: eerst de aanvragerservaring, met binnen de beta ook vaste ruimte voor onderzoek en testen.","claim":"The approach prioritized the applicant experience and included scheduled time for research and testing during private beta.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"My team focused on the users applying for refunds first and this is what we took to the alpha assessment.","narrative":"De beschreven aanpak combineerde een volgorde waarin aanvragers eerst kwamen met expliciet gereserveerde tijd voor onderzoek en testen.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This summarizes the source-supported sequencing and the fortnightly sprint plan, without asserting that either caused the launch or results.","materiality":"It frames the described workflow, rather than presenting it as a causal finding or general recommendation."}]}

